# vcf2maf annotation (VEP), ported verbatim from upstream
# workflow/common/rules/merge_loop.smk (loop_vcf2maf_paired) and
# merge_loop_germline.smk (loop_vcf2maf_germ_paired).
# Static per-caller rules with the upstream get_vcf_name() tumor/normal IDs
# (vardict/mutect2/HC/strelkamanta -> {sample}_T/{sample}_NC;
#  muse/varscan2 -> TUMOR/NORMAL;  caveman -> TUMOUR/NORMAL).

[workflow]
name = "vcf2maf"

[[rules]]
name = "vcf2maf_Mutect2"
input = [
    "{config.output_dir}/{config.genome_version}/results/vcf_norm/paired/{pair_id}/Mutect2.vcf",
    "{config.reference}"
]
output = [ "{config.output_dir}/{config.genome_version}/results/maf/paired/{pair_id}/Mutect2.vcf.maf" ]
description = "vcf2maf on Mutect2 (tumor-id {sample}_T / normal-id {sample}_NC)"
shell = """vcf2maf.pl --input-vcf {input[0]} --output-maf {output[0]} --ref-fasta {config.reference} --tumor-id {pair_id}_T --normal-id {pair_id}_NC --vep-path $(realpath $(dirname $(which vep))) --vep-data {config.vep_data} --vep-fork 40 --vep-overwrite --species {config.vep_species} --ncbi-build {config.ncbi_build} --cache-version {config.vep_cache_version}"""
[rules.environment]
conda = "envs/clindet_vep.yaml"

[[rules]]
name = "vcf2maf_vardict"
